whats-new: Club Manager: players other clubs buy stay bought. You told us a player who moved between two other clubs vanished from the game and turned up back at his old club the next season. In a Club Manager career started after the 13 October update, that deal now sticks: he is in his new club's squad straight away, plays for them against you, shows up on the market at his new club (not for sale until the summer), and is still there next season. If your career is that new and already lost someone this season, opening it puts him back where he went. Careers started before that update keep the world they had.
